---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About | Alex C Warren"
  description="Learn about Alex C Warren, his software engineering background, independent projects, and interest in game development."
>
  <main id="main-content" tabindex="-1">
    <section>
      <p class="hero-label">About</p>
      <h1>Software engineer, builder, and lifelong learner.</h1>

      <p class="hero-summary">
        I'm Alex, a senior software engineer with over a decade of experience
        building backend systems, internal tools, and developer workflows.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>What I Work On</h2>

      <p>
        My professional interests center on backend engineering,
        infrastructure, automation, and improving the way developers build
        and maintain software.
      </p>

      <p>
        Outside of work, I build small tools and applications that let me
        explore ideas, sharpen my engineering skills, and practice actually
        shipping software instead of leaving projects permanently unfinished.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Independent Projects</h2>

      <p>
        A lot of my personal work currently involves Python developer tools
        and utilities, along with smaller game-development projects built in
        Godot.
      </p>

      <p>
        I'm especially interested in projects where I can learn something
        useful, solve a real problem, and turn the result into software that
        someone else could actually use.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Game Development</h2>

      <p>
        Game development is one of the ways I explore software from a different
        angle. I'm currently focused on smaller, achievable projects while
        learning more about game design, interaction, UI, and how to finish
        and release games as a solo developer.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Elsewhere</h2>

      <p>
        You can find my code and current projects on GitHub. I'll also be using
        this site to publish technical articles and project write-ups as that
        work develops.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>